+GET    /admin/api/games/{id}/stats/retention?days=30    D1/D7/D30 留存时序
+GET    /admin/api/games/{id}/stats/funnel?days=30       注册漏斗
+POST   /admin/api/players/{pid}/ban               {"reason","duration_secs"?} 0 或省略=永久
